But host Karen Hunter tweeted that West was simply “what it is and that’s just wonderful.”
“But I chose NOT to reward someone (buying their music or clothes or supporting their ‘art’) that I believe is embracing a vomiting ideology that’s harmful to my community.
It's free.
And so are we," he added.
Prior to the show, the rapper announced on Twitter that he had changed his name, saying he is now “the person previously known as Kanye West.”
