It's not the first time Palin's been accused of criminal acts.
In December 2017 he was accused of assaulting his father, Todd Palin.
The mother, Sarah Palin, called police to report the alleged assault.
The case is currently under scrutiny from the Veteran's Court in Alaska.
In January 2016 he was accused of domestic assault, of obstructing the complaint of the crime and possession of a weapon while he was drunk in connection with the incident.
