In March, Conservative MP Peter Bone claimed in Birmingham that the UK "would already be out of Europe" if Farage were the Secretary for Brexit.
But May's challenges to try to reconcile her party's deeply-divided positions have been underlined by Tories in favour of staying in Europe who participated in a separate protest against Brexit in London.
