Humphreys, who has been friends with Davies for years, has lost Mark, her partner for 15 years, not long after the death of his mother.
"You never said he was feeling down or depressed," she recounts.
“A couple of days before Christmas we noticed that his attitude had changed.
On Christmas Day he hit rock bottom. When the children opened the presents, he avoided looking them in the eye.”
He says his death was a huge trauma they had to process: "He tore up the family.
He tore us apart.
